OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PC charged over indecent
OL,4,Aimages of children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former West Yorkshire Police officer
OL,7,Fhas been charged with possessing
OL,8,Findecent images of children.
OL,10,FZachary Haile, who was based in the
OL,11,FLeeds District, had been charged with
OL,12,Fthree counts of possessing indecent
OL,13,Fphotographs and one count of engaging
OL,14,Fin sexual communication with a child, a
OL,15,Fforce spokesperson said.
OL,17,FThe charges related to matters which
OL,18,Fwere alleged to have occurred in 2022
OL,19,Fwhile Haile was off-duty, they added.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
